# spec-integrator cache & reports
# Audit evidence stays out of Git. CI restores a document/verifier hash-matched
# Actions cache and fails when no current evidence exists. Explicit manual Jev
# audits refresh this cache; tools/README.md documents the workflow.
.spec-integrator/doc_cache.db
doc_report.md
spec_report.md
doc_graph.json

